ute_result","data":{"text/plain":["(5000, 12)"]},"metadata":{},"execution_count":20}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["There were 30 duplicate rows in the dataset. The duplicate rows were removed using drop_duplicates(). After removing duplicates, the dataset contains 5000 rows."],"metadata":{"id":"hH5nWQbK-94_"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["#Correlation Heatmap (after cleaning)\n","numeric_df = df.select_dtypes(include=\"number\")\n","sns.heatmap(numeric_df.corr(), annot=True, cmap=\"coolwarm\")\n","plt.title(\"Correlation Heatmap\", fontweight=\"bold\")\n","plt.show()"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":209},"id":"oYT6bvfd_DlI","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1786689804627,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":628,"user":{"displayName":"Manish Bhandri","userId":"04433092828126077522"}},"outputId":"4bfb09d0-ed5b-4d3b-bb01-1a8484d5a261"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 640x480 with 2 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["The heatmap shows weak-to-moderate correlations among the numerical features, meaning no single numeric variable dominates and multicollinearity is not a major concern for this dataset."],"metadata":{"id":"FfsYhBB4_Lj1"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["##Data Preprocessing"],"metadata":{"id":"EwDWkROZ_QmB"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["\n","numeric_features = [\"Age\", \"AnnualIncome\", \"TimeSpentOnSite\",\n","                     \"PagesViewed\", \"PreviousPurchases\"]\n","\n","categorical_features = [\"Gender\", \"DeviceType\", \"EmailOpened\",\n","                         \"AdClicked\", \"MembershipType\", \"DiscountOffered\"]"],"metadata":{"id":"APinWN7_ME5Z","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1786692786921,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":7,"user":{"displayName":"Manish Bhandri","userId":"04433092828126077522"}}},"execution_count":74,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["X_num = df[numer